Modifications
-------------

The following changes were made by WikDra on top of the upstream projects and
are also released under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  * discord_bot/ - a new Discord bot front-end for real-time music generation
    in voice channels (slash commands, generation queue, presets, playback
    control, file upload).
  * VRAM and CPU-offload optimisations for running inference on 8 GB GPUs.
  * Windows setup scripts (setup.bat, setup_advanced_pip.bat,
    update_upstream.bat) and the accompanying documentation.
  * Additional documentation: README_DISCORD.md, VRAM_OPTIMIZATION.md,
    ACE_STEP_CPU_OFFLOAD_FIX.md, LLM_GPU_ACCELERATION.md.

